# Local env files — VITE_* vars here are build-time and end up in the client
# bundle, so this file existing at all was already something to be careful
# with; it was never in this ignore list before. No SMTP/Gmail/Resend
# credentials belong in any .env file regardless — those are Supabase
# server-side config (Dashboard → Authentication → SMTP, and Dashboard →
# Edge Functions → Secrets), never a Vite env var, never committed here.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
